mithril: mithril (IoT static scanner for secrets, SBOM, CVEs and more.)
mithril:
mithril: mithril analyzes the contents of firmware and IoT software, whether a
mithril: single file or an unpacked rootfs. It looks for embedded secrets
mithril: and keys, a software bill of materials (SBOM), known CVEs affecting
mithril: those components, open-source licenses, boot-security posture
mithril: (U-Boot env, device tree, FIT/AVB/UEFI verified boot), and weak or
mithril: leaked public keys (keys whose private half is public, ROCA,
mithril: undersized RSA). It reports each finding with its evidence and a
mithril: confidence, and it speaks clean JSON so scripts and LLM agents can
mithril: drive it as easily as people can.
